{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "input.file",
      "name": "Image file",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "assets/line_signal.png",
        "source_mode": "single",
        "paths": [],
        "directory": "",
        "recursive": false,
        "repeat": "stop",
        "filename_ticket": true,
        "metadata_mode": "off",
        "color_format": "gray",
        "pixel_depth": "unchanged",
        "path_base": "project"
      },
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "exposed_inputs": [
        "ticket"
      ],
      "exposed_outputs": [
        "image",
        "info",
        "ticket"
      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "calibration",
      "type": "input.calibration",
      "name": "Load calibration profile",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "assets/workplane.json",
        "path_base": "project"
      },
      "position": [
        0,
        400
      ],
      "exposed_inputs": [
        "ticket"
      ],
      "exposed_outputs": [
        "profile",
        "ticket"
      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "plane",
      "type": "calibration.rectify_workplane",
      "name": "Rectify workplane",
      "parameters": {
        "origin": [
          0.0,
          0.0
        ],
        "width": 513,
        "height": 64,
        "units_per_pixel": 0.25,
        "maximum_rms_error": 1.0,
        "registration": "fixed_grid",
        "interpolation": "linear"
      },
      "position": [
        400,
        0
      ],
      "exposed_inputs": [
        "image",
        "mapping",
        "mask",
        "region"
      ],
      "exposed_outputs": [
        "image",
        "valid_mask",
        "geometry",
        "scale"
      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "path_0",
      "type": "cv.path_intensity_profile",
      "name": "Path intensity profile",
      "parameters": {
        "vertices": [
          [
            0,
            16
          ],
          [
            512,
            16
          ]
        ],
        "closed": false,
        "sample_spacing": 1,
        "interpolation": "linear",
        "include_alpha": false
      },
      "position": [
        800,
        0
      ],
      "exposed_inputs": [
        "image",
        "mask",
        "region",
        "path"
      ],
      "exposed_outputs": [
        "profile",
        "points",
        "path_length",
        "selected_count"
      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "resample_0",
      "type": "cv.resample_image_profile",
      "name": "Resample image profile",
      "description": "Align measured image profiles to an exact pixel or physical pitch.",
      "documentation": "<p>Resamples uniform path measurements while retaining source image coordinates, tickets and explicit invalid gaps. A reference profile supplies a shared distance grid. Rate-aware Kaiser filtering suppresses aliases during decimation. See docs/profile-resampling.md for boundary, calibration and validity contracts.</p>",
      "parameters": {
        "grid": "own_extent",
        "pitch": 1,
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 100.0,
        "distance_origin": 0.0,
        "method": "kaiser_sinc",
        "antialias": true,
        "kernel_lobes": 12,
        "window_beta": 8.6,
        "rolloff": 0.9,
        "boundary": "reflect",
        "maximum_work": 8000000
      },
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ],
      "node_size": "large",
      "exposed_inputs": [
        "profile",
        "reference",
        "scale"
      ],
      "exposed_outputs": [
        "profile",
        "points",
        "valid",
        "selected_count",
        "report"
      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "path_1",
      "type": "cv.path_intensity_profile",
      "name": "Path intensity profile",
      "parameters": {
        "vertices": [
          [
            0,
            48
          ],
          [
            512,
            48
          ]
        ],
        "closed": false,
        "sample_spacing": 0.5,
        "interpolation": "linear",
        "include_alpha": false
      },
      "position": [
        800,
        320
      ],
      "exposed_inputs": [
        "image",
        "mask",
        "region",
        "path"
      ],
      "exposed_outputs": [
        "profile",
        "points",
        "path_length",
        "selected_count"
      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "resample_1",
      "type": "cv.resample_image_profile",
      "name": "Resample image profile",
      "description": "Align measured image profiles to an exact pixel or physical pitch.",
      "documentation": "<p>Resamples uniform path measurements while retaining source image coordinates, tickets and explicit invalid gaps. A reference profile supplies a shared distance grid. Rate-aware Kaiser filtering suppresses aliases during decimation. See docs/profile-resampling.md for boundary, calibration and validity contracts.</p>",
      "parameters": {
        "grid": "reference",
        "pitch": 1,
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 100.0,
        "distance_origin": 0.0,
        "method": "kaiser_sinc",
        "antialias": true,
        "kernel_lobes": 12,
        "window_beta": 8.6,
        "rolloff": 0.9,
        "boundary": "reflect",
        "maximum_work": 8000000
      },
      "position": [
        1200,
        320
      ],
      "node_size": "large",
      "exposed_inputs": [
        "profile",
        "reference",
        "scale"
      ],
      "exposed_outputs": [
        "profile",
        "points",
        "valid",
        "selected_count",
        "report"
      ],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "attribution",
      "type": "layout.comment",
      "name": "Original measured-profile fixtures - MIT",
      "description": "Original MIT high-depth image, calibration fixture, generator and projects by OpenCVDataflowGUI contributors. No customer or third-party images. The two horizontal paths share intensity but have their own image coordinates. One resampler supplies the common reference distance grid. Physical common uses a declared .25 mm/px rectified-workplane scale. Masked decimation compares antialiased filtering with unfiltered sampling and preserves a taught gap. Filter support widens the invalid gap; it never invents data across it. The Float64 Kaiser implementation is original; the installed native signal resampler did not qualify the tested decimation/coordinate requirements. These synthetic profiles are engineering checks, not calibration acceptance.",
      "parameters": {},
      "position": [
        0,
        -600
      ],
      "node_size": "large",
      "exposed_inputs": [],
      "exposed_outputs": [],
      "thumbnail": true,
      "preview_output": ""
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
    {
      "source": "capture",
      "output": "image",
      "target": "plane",
      "input": "image"
    },
    {
      "source": "calibration",
      "output": "profile",
      "target": "plane",
      "input": "mapping"
    },
    {
      "source": "plane",
      "output": "image",
      "target": "path_0",
      "input": "image"
    },
    {
      "source": "path_0",
      "output": "profile",
      "target": "resample_0",
      "input": "profile"
    },
    {
      "source": "plane",
      "output": "scale",
      "target": "resample_0",
      "input": "scale"
    },
    {
      "source": "plane",
      "output": "image",
      "target": "path_1",
      "input": "image"
    },
    {
      "source": "path_1",
      "output": "profile",
      "target": "resample_1",
      "input": "profile"
    },
    {
      "source": "resample_0",
      "output": "profile",
      "target": "resample_1",
      "input": "reference"
    },
    {
      "source": "plane",
      "output": "scale",
      "target": "resample_1",
      "input": "scale"
    }
  ]
}
